1
00:00:00,196 --> 00:00:00,950
Delapan puluh tentara

2
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:01,855
berangkat perang.

3
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:03,427
Yang pulang,

4
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:04,637
konon, delapan puluh satu.

5
00:00:04,657 --> 00:00:05,720
Ini Liechtenstein,

6
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,098
negara kecil di Pegunungan

7
00:00:07,118 --> 00:00:08,832
Alpen, di antara Swiss dan

8
00:00:08,852 --> 00:00:09,661
Austria.

9
00:00:09,681 --> 00:00:11,132
Tahun 1866,

10
00:00:11,152 --> 00:00:13,010
pecah Perang Austria-Prusia.

11
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,450
Pangeran Johann Kedua

12
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,982
menyerahkan pasukannya ke

13
00:00:16,002 --> 00:00:17,561
Konfederasi Jerman,

14
00:00:17,581 --> 00:00:18,521
dengan syarat:

15
00:00:18,541 --> 00:00:19,852
hanya untuk menjaga Tirol,

16
00:00:19,872 --> 00:00:21,292
dan tidak melawan sesama orang

17
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:22,143
Jerman.

18
00:00:22,163 --> 00:00:23,288
Parlemennya tidak diajak

19
00:00:23,308 --> 00:00:24,821
bicara, dan perang ini tidak

20
00:00:24,841 --> 00:00:25,715
populer.

21
00:00:25,735 --> 00:00:26,737
Pasukan dipimpin Peter

22
00:00:26,757 --> 00:00:27,800
Rheinberger.

23
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,410
Mereka berjaga di celah gunung

24
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:30,618
Stilfser Joch,

25
00:00:30,638 --> 00:00:31,732
mengawasi kemungkinan serangan

26
00:00:31,752 --> 00:00:32,893
pasukan Italia di bawah

27
00:00:32,913 --> 00:00:33,761
Garibaldi.

28
00:00:33,781 --> 00:00:34,922
Dua orang tinggal menjaga

29
00:00:34,942 --> 00:00:35,841
Kastil Vaduz.

30
00:00:35,861 --> 00:00:37,149
Tak ada pertempuran besar bagi

31
00:00:37,169 --> 00:00:38,031
mereka.

32
00:00:38,051 --> 00:00:40,152
Perang berakhir 22 Juli,

33
00:00:40,172 --> 00:00:41,360
