41
00:00:50,301 --> 00:00:51,442
Ada juga yang bilang petani

42
00:00:51,462 --> 00:00:52,145
Italia.

43
00:00:52,165 --> 00:00:53,492
Sejarawan menyebutnya legenda

44
00:00:53,512 --> 00:00:54,119
populer.

45
00:00:54,139 --> 00:00:55,017
Yang pasti,

46
00:00:55,037 --> 00:00:57,648
dua belas Februari 1868,

47
00:00:57,668 --> 00:00:58,732
Liechtenstein membubarkan

48
00:00:58,752 --> 00:01:00,233
